[I] C++ library for fast Gauss transforms

[T] fgt is a C++ library for computing the Gauss transform, the per-point
[T] similarity between two data sets, using the direct method as well as
[T] faster approximations like the improved fast Gauss transform. It is used
[T] e.g. by the cpd point set registration library.

[U] https://github.com/gadomski/fgt

[A] Fgt Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/base
[F] CROSS

[V] 0.4.11
[L] LGPL

